{
	"id":"pkg:maven/today.bonfire.oss/simple-object-pool",
	"description":"A lightweight, thread-safe object pooling library for Java applications.\n        Features:\n        - Thread-safe object pooling using ReentrantLock\n        - Configurable pool size with min and max limits\n        - Automatic idle object eviction\n        - Abandoned object detection and cleanup\n        - Support for object validation and health checks\n        - Simple and intuitive API\n        - Zero external dependencies (except SLF4J for logging)\n        - Java 21+ compatible\n\n        Perfect for managing expensive resources like database connections, network sockets, or any reusable objects.\n        (can be used for jedis, redisson, etc.)",
